Task 1: Configure Prometheus to Collect Performance Metrics
Subtask 1.1: Verify RHACM Observability Components
First, let's check if the observability components are properly installed and running.

Access your lab environment by clicking the terminal icon on your desktop.

Verify you're connected to the hub cluster:

oc whoami
oc cluster-info
Check the observability namespace:
oc get namespace open-cluster-management-observability
Verify observability pods are running:
oc get pods -n open-cluster-management-observability
Expected output should show pods like:

observability-thanos-query
observability-grafana
observability-alertmanager
Subtask 1.2: Enable Observability on Managed Clusters
List your managed clusters:
oc get managedclusters
Create observability addon configuration:
cat > observability-addon.yaml << 'EOF'
apiVersion: addon.open-cluster-management.io/v1alpha1
kind: ManagedClusterAddOn
metadata:
  name: observability-controller
  namespace: cluster1
spec:
  installNamespace: open-cluster-management-addon-observability
---
apiVersion: addon.open-cluster-management.io/v1alpha1
kind: ManagedClusterAddOn
metadata:
  name: observability-controller
  namespace: cluster2
spec:
  installNamespace: open-cluster-management-addon-observability
EOF
Apply the observability addon:
oc apply -f observability-addon.yaml
Verify addon installation:
oc get managedclusteraddons -A | grep observability
Subtask 1.3: Configure Custom Metrics Collection
Create a custom ServiceMonitor for application metrics:
cat > custom-servicemonitor.yaml << 'EOF'
apiVersion: monitoring.coreos.com/v1
kind: ServiceMonitor
metadata:
  name: sample-app-metrics
  namespace: open-cluster-management-observability
  labels:
    app: sample-monitoring
spec:
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: sample-app
  endpoints:
  - port: metrics
    interval: 30s
    path: /metrics
  namespaceSelector:
    matchNames:
    - default
    - sample-app-namespace
EOF
Apply the ServiceMonitor:
oc apply -f custom-servicemonitor.yaml
Verify Prometheus is collecting metrics:
oc exec -n open-cluster-management-observability deployment/observability-thanos-query -- \
  curl -s "http://localhost:9090/api/v1/targets" | jq '.data.activeTargets[] | select(.labels.job=="sample-app-metrics")'
